# Stage 0: the native iOS project is generated on the CI runner (no Mac to commit one).
# Committed once real native code lands — see PLAN-STAGE-0 §5.
#
# ⚑ ANCHORED, and it was not, and that cost the second proof (2026-08-14). An unanchored `ios/`
# matches a directory of that name at EVERY level, and a Capacitor plugin package keeps its Swift
# in exactly such a directory — so `native/hs-native/ios/Sources/.../HSShellPlugin.swift` was
# silently never committed. The tethered build read it off the Mac's disk and passed; CI checked
# out a repo without it and failed to resolve the package. 312 tests, a clean typecheck and a
# green run on real hardware were all blind to a file that existed on one machine.
/ios/
# generated at build time by scripts/gen-icons.mjs (predev/prebuild hooks)
public/icons/
*.local
.DS_Store
# Xcode writes per-user scheme state into the plugin package when the project is opened.
.swiftpm/
